    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905030/extras/818b01c383d1436ef1d41cce1b2a5bd7.webp?t=1739674460\" width=627 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 12 different types of Coffee, each requiring different percentages of Coffee, Water &amp; Milk! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905030/extras/f3d22014c7d042d124a9128466631b87.webp?t=1739674460\" width=627 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't drop things! Based entirely around physics, ensure you're careful clicking &amp; dragging objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905030/extras/fdc1f1486642240d990da6e3015ef78c.webp?t=1739674460\" width=627 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrons don't have all day, keep them satisfied through fulfilling their orders in a timely manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
